16. NEWAX PRINCIPLE

The system should do the work.

The client should not have to manage technical complexity.

Every implementation decision must aim to:

Simplify operations.

Reduce unnecessary complexity.

Improve reliability.

Increase visibility.

Strengthen ownership.

Preserve long-term maintainability.


Technology is a means.

